{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019hTAhZhesQDC5n4sv6TtTC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BKtD7z4Ffu8Tzi6o3xKocv","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"xling_calib_direction","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1840,"cache_read_input_tokens":17637,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1840,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q7yTddsvZnhyAKbGetqXdY","session_id":"91a2196c-7a23-4294-80ba-646c05703e7b","uuid":"ad90ae7c-6d4f-4db8-ab31-2fb9b54b4bf4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BKtD7z4Ffu8Tzi6o3xKocv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-21: Simpson's Paradox in CKA-transfer relationship (D012 关键发现)\\\\n\\\\n- **发现**: CKA vs transfer AUROC 存在 Simpson's Paradox——pool 所有 layer 时弱负相关 (rho≈−0.16)，控制 depth 后符号反转为正 (Llama rho=+0.41 p=0.006, Qwen rho=+0.18 ns)\\\\n- **机制**: CKA 随 depth 下降，AUROC 随 depth 上升，两趋势相消产生虚假负相关。同一 depth 下，CKA 越高 → transfer 越好\\\\n- **意义**: 直接回应 Reviewer depth confound 质疑；符号反转本身是 publishable finding\\\\n- **局限**: Qwen partial rho underpowered (n=40)，per-layer n=5 只能看方向。Full-scale 20 langs 会大幅增加统计功效\\\\n- **决策影响**: 如 Director 确认，paper_framing 中 CKA 分析可从 \\\\\\\"suggestive correlation\\\\\\\" 升级\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-21: run_plan_001.sh 关键设计决策\\\\n\\\\n- **GPTQ 加载**: `--quantization none` 让 HF 自动检测 GPTQ（不用 bitsandbytes NF4）\\\\n- **Train/eval split**: `--split_ratio 0.7` 产出 `_train.pt`/`_eval.pt`，symlink 桥接下游脚本\\\\n- **Procrustes 平行配对**: for_eval/ 中 EN 必须指向 eval split（与 target 平行），已修复初始 bug\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-21: 模型下载路径\\\\n\\\\n- Llama4 正确路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Llama4-Scout-W4A16`（不带连字符）\\\\n- Qwen3 路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-235B-GPTQ-Int4`\\\\n- 必须用 `HF_HUB_DISABLE_XET=1`（在 os.environ 中设置）+ `hf-mirror.com`\\\\n- `python3` 不在 PATH，用 `/root/miniconda3/bin/python3`\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1108, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q7yTddsvZnhyAKbGetqXdY","session_id":"91a2196c-7a23-4294-80ba-646c05703e7b","uuid":"90c738e8-2573-419b-8b89-511a0d0513a9","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:01:00.605Z"}
